{"unit_id":"HarryLi-7__dsh-zh#card-zh","repo":"HarryLi-7/dsh-zh","commit":"8dc22989caa08d1e6d7a9aa807b69d5f94ad1ef6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的中文界面插件。它在客户端 DOM 显示层精确替换命令面板描述、权限预设和推理等级等界面文字，并提供完全访问预设的强调色及运行状态光影效果。插件还会读取宿主命令、权限设置和模型信息，检测官方是否已调整相应文案，并在变化时显示一次性提示。设置页提供汉化开关，关闭后可还原替换文字。适合希望使用中文 DSH Web 界面的用户；无需额外服务或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:142-170","lib/client.js:236-299","lib/client.js:359-430"]}
{"unit_id":"HarryLi-7__dsh-zh#card-en","repo":"HarryLi-7/dsh-zh","commit":"8dc22989caa08d1e6d7a9aa807b69d5f94ad1ef6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-zh localizes selected DSH Web labels for commands, permissions, and reasoning levels. It adds an accent for Full access and a running status shimmer, and detects changed host wording with a one-time notice. A settings toggle disables localization and restores replaced text.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:142-170","lib/client.js:236-299","lib/client.js:359-430"]}
