{"unit_id":"HarryLi-7__dsh-zh#feature-1","repo":"HarryLi-7/dsh-zh","commit":"8dc22989caa08d1e6d7a9aa807b69d5f94ad1ef6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh 的功能「界面文字汉化」：将命令面板描述、权限预设和推理等级等匹配的界面文本替换为中文，跳过会话内容和输入区域。页面 DOM 更新时会重新扫描，触发方式为插件加载及界面变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:30-60","lib/client.js:93-105","lib/client.js:173-202"]}
{"unit_id":"HarryLi-7__dsh-zh#feature-2","repo":"HarryLi-7/dsh-zh","commit":"8dc22989caa08d1e6d7a9aa807b69d5f94ad1ef6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh 的功能「官方适配提示」：页面加载后读取命令、权限 schema 和模型数据，与插件覆盖的文案比较；检测到变化时在页面顶部显示可关闭的一次性提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:236-299","lib/client.js:308-353","lib/client.js:471-482"]}
{"unit_id":"HarryLi-7__dsh-zh#feature-3","repo":"HarryLi-7/dsh-zh","commit":"8dc22989caa08d1e6d7a9aa807b69d5f94ad1ef6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh 的功能「汉化开关」：在通用设置中提供开关；关闭后停止 DOM 观察、还原已替换文字并清除样式标记，重新开启后继续应用汉化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:195-220","lib/client.js:359-430"]}
{"unit_id":"HarryLi-7__dsh-zh#feature-4","repo":"HarryLi-7/dsh-zh","commit":"8dc22989caa08d1e6d7a9aa807b69d5f94ad1ef6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh 的功能「权限与运行状态强调效果」：为完全访问选项的文字和图标添加强调色，并为运行状态添加 shimmer 动画样式。随客户端插件启用加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:62-79","lib/client.js:155-169","lib/client.js:446-453"]}
{"unit_id":"HarryLi-7__dsh-zh#caveat-1","repo":"HarryLi-7/dsh-zh","commit":"8dc22989caa08d1e6d7a9aa807b69d5f94ad1ef6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zh 使用浏览器 localStorage 保存开关状态和最近一次探测结果（两个固定键），以便跨页面加载保留设置并避免重复提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:26-27","lib/client.js:114-120","lib/client.js:349-352","lib/client.js:463-480"]}
